{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skullbot Prime, a rogue AI, and its creator Dr. Nefarious have taken over every sorting company in the galaxy, forcing workers into servitude to fuel the Doctor\u2019s life force. The last company standing is <strong>Sorted Inc.</strong>, and survival means earning an <strong>Indestructible Contract</strong> that makes them impossible to acquire. To prove they deserve it, players must conquer <strong>24 levels</strong> across <i>three hostile zones</i> \u2014 with every 8th level ending in a boss battle where workers weaponize sorted items to fight back against their corporate overlords in this\u00a0<i>online co-op game</i> for One to Four players!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/a922712a0f25331fd4d2685dfef70f2c.poster.avif?t=1772604827\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/a922712a0f25331fd4d2685dfef70f2c.webm?t=1772604827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/a922712a0f25331fd4d2685dfef70f2c.mp4?t=1772604827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOOLS OF THE JOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorted Inc. is chasing the ultimate legal shield: the <strong>Indestructible Contract</strong>, a document that makes a company permanently un-acquirable. To earn it, the crew must prove they can sort through chaos using a suite of industrial machines. Operate <strong>Stampers</strong>, <strong>Combination </strong>units, and <strong>Sorting </strong>systems to process products efficiently and ship them off the station into the hands of waiting <i><strong>customers</strong></i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/94c87b85c84dbe7891d8ebd48519d8f6.poster.avif?t=1772604827\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/94c87b85c84dbe7891d8ebd48519d8f6.webm?t=1772604827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/94c87b85c84dbe7891d8ebd48519d8f6.mp4?t=1772604827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessorize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your worker and sort in style. Swap heads, throw on hats, rock new eyewear, and strap on backpacks \u2014 because saving the company should look good.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/9b1040943ca7ce4b5b79c78c0ff14511.poster.avif?t=1772604827\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/9b1040943ca7ce4b5b79c78c0ff14511.webm?t=1772604827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/9b1040943ca7ce4b5b79c78c0ff14511.mp4?t=1772604827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your playstyle as you tackle each station\u2019s unique layout and wild hazards. Will your robot rise to the challenge, or will your rival sorting company crush you?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/6a922e65837b62c851bdec0449b7c486.poster.avif?t=1772604827\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/6a922e65837b62c851bdec0449b7c486.webm?t=1772604827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315490/extras/6a922e65837b62c851bdec0449b7c486.mp4?t=1772604827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Try!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/12a072b08b12f86994e1ebdeb7583dccf1174562.jpg"},{"name":"Shooting Star!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/2c99bc7f5db3e1d8934379e61299c54712fd4be0.jpg"},{"name":"Perfection!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/e78bfe5c91bfc19aee59e3f82578f6767f81a24a.jpg"},{"name":"Priorities First!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/5f187aefdc02f960ebb80a62cc547563b074045d.jpg"},{"name":"Ice Ice Baby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/7edae161608def30d8795bd1c1168e3b1c671bad.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019ll Be Back!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/0e03730e06d66e8914d9ffd14a9cc88e636d9740.jpg"},{"name":"Special Delivery!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/cf2881a5c04704f0baa8346a8476cc9478b0c361.jpg"},{"name":"Headless Sort Man!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/1c637e8dfdd754fe9b899448fa39dd133253cf64.jpg"},{"name":"Face Off!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/e147d7d9031049176c281f408ad672be5170faae.jpg"},{"name":"Terminus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315490/1268ca5455cc9f036f1df0768cdde441b2b8a19e.jpg"}],"total":39},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/imag